    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sherry Property Consultants are delighted to bring to the market this impressive 5 bedroom detached residence at Greatwood, Ardee, Co. Louth. Built in 2002 and extending to approximately 190 sq.m., this substantial family home enjoys a peaceful setting while offering excellent accessibility to Ardee, Carrickmacross, Dundalk, Drogheda and the M1 motorway network.\r\n\r\nThis bright and spacious property offers generous and versatile accommodation over two floors and is ideally suited to modern family living. The property has been carefully enhanced with a range of excellent features including CCTV, an alarm system, electric gates, extensive outdoor lighting, fibre broadband, smart heating controls and a water filtration system.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises on the ground floor: entrance hall, spacious kitchen/dining room, living room, family bathroom and three bedrooms, one of which is en-suite. Upstairs comprises two further exceptionally generous bedrooms, both of which are en-suite, together with a walk-in wardrobe and additional storage.\r\n\r\nA particular feature of this wonderful property is the south-facing rear garden, which provides an excellent private outdoor space. The garden also benefits from a fully serviced outdoor entertainment cabin complete with fitted bar. A cobblelock patio provides an ideal setting for outdoor entertaining and enjoying the garden throughout the year.\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property benefits from electric gated access and extensive parking. The combination of generous internal accommodation, excellent security features, smart technology and the exceptional outdoor entertainment space makes this a superb family home.\r\n\r\nGreatwood enjoys a peaceful setting with excellent accessibility and is conveniently located close to a wide range of essential amenities. Ardee town is within easy reach and offers an excellent selection of schools, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, sporting facilities, healthcare services and everyday conveniences. Carrickmacross is also within easy reach, while Dundalk, Drogheda and Navan are all easily accessible.\r\n\r\nFor commuters, the property is particularly well positioned. The M1 motorway network is readily accessible. Dublin, Belfast and Dublin Airport are all within comfortable commuting distance, making this an ideal location for those seeking the benefits of a peaceful residential setting without compromising on accessibility.\r\n\r\nApproximate journey times:\r\nArdee: 15 minutes / 11 km\r\nCarrickmacross: 16 minutes / 17 km\r\nDundalk: 30 minutes / 25 km\r\nDrogheda: 32 minutes / 36 km\r\nNavan:40 minutes / 35 km\r\nDublin Airport: 50 minutes / 75 km\r\nBelfast: 1 hour 20 minutes / 115 km\r\n\r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity to acquire a spacious 5 bedroom detached family home in a peaceful and highly convenient location. With approximately 190 sq.m. of accommodation, three en-suite bedrooms, a south-facing rear garden, a fully equipped outdoor entertainment cabin and an impressive range of security and modern living features, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended. Viewing is strictly by appointment only.\r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n\r\n*5 bedroom detached residence\r\n*Approximately 190 sq.m.\r\n*Built in 2002\r\n*BER B3\r\n*3 en-suite bedrooms\r\n*Spacious accommodation over two floors\r\n*South-facing rear garden\r\n*Cobblelock patio\r\n*CCTV\r\n*Alarm system\r\n*Electric gates\r\n*Extensive outdoor lighting\r\n*Fibre broadband\r\n*Smart heating controls\r\n*Water filtration system\r\n*Extensive off-street parking\r\n*Peaceful residential setting\r\n*Excellent access to Ardee, Carrickmacross and the M1 motorway"
      },
